B.SZ=new A.aM(B.F,B.a3,8,"E and I: Reach Up","Reach up with your middle fingers to E (left) and I (right).","ee e;e iii jij ;e; ij iei fii iii eie eee iii eel ee; fi iii ee eel jij side like life lie die kid ill sell feel seed fled dies hide isle alike self kiss skill shed heal lead idea",90,0,"Stage 2 \xb7 Top Row","ei","Left middle: E \xb7 Right middle: I","Reach up from D and K, then return to the home row. The other fingers stay in place.")
B.SS=new A.aM(B.F,B.a3,9,"R and U: Index Fingers Up","Reach up with your index fingers to R (left) and U (right).","uuj rr uru jr srs ur rrr uu ur rrl rrr srs rrr uhu uuu rrr huu uu rd rr rude ruled user dark lurk sure hurdle fur rug jug hug rush real raised rid ride rural surf slur lure sulk",90,0,"Stage 2 \xb7 Top Row","ru","Left index: R \xb7 Right index: U",u.v)
B.T2=new A.aM(B.F,B.a3,10,"T and Y: Index Stretch Up","Stretch your index fingers to T (left) and Y (right).","yt tt ttj tkt yyy yty lt yy yt yys ftt ete tt tyt ttt yl yyy ti ty yyl that they tall study dusty stay yet tray style turtle tail fifty guilty hasty yard duty tidy lately daily safety thirsty",90,0,"Stage 2 \xb7 Top Row","ty","Left index: T \xb7 Right index: Y","Use the same index finger that types R or U \u2014 just stretch it one key further.")
B.Td=new A.aM(B.F,B.a3,11,"W and O: Ring Fingers Up","Reach up with your ring fingers to W (left) and O (right).","oo ewe eoe hww oo ww owo ww wow joo sw owo ow ww awa jw wwj www lwl wo word wood low slow those wolf follow show would hello wall wide owl glow owe row work world worth throw tow",90,0,"Stage 2 \xb7 Top Row","wo","Left ring: W \xb7 Right ring: O","Ring fingers need practice. Slow and accurate is better than fast and wrong.")
B.SX=new A.aM(B.F,B.a3,12,"Q and P: Little Fingers Up","Reach up with your little fingers to Q (left) and P (right).","qqq qtq sps ppp qp ppp pph pgp qq qqq pk pp kp qsq pq qqq qfq iq ppk qp quiet quote puppy paper pour quite queue equal pilot spoil power pure quirk upper happy please pull page quilt",90,0,"Stage 2 \xb7 Top Row","qp","Left little: Q \xb7 Right little: P","These are the farthest top-row keys. Keep your wrist steady and move only your finger.")
B.S0=new A.aM(B.F,B.a3,13,"Top Row Words",u.d,"quiet write your tree pretty wire quote type require water flower tired paper surely rough she wrote her poetry; the poet felt tired; a quiet lad kept the key",90,0,"Stage 2 \xb7 Top Row","","All eight fingers","Say each word in your head while you type it. It helps your fingers remember.")
B.S2=new A.aM(B.F,B.a3,14,"Top Row Review","More top row and home row practice.","a quiet lad kept the key; she poured the water; his paper fell; the pilot wrote her letter; where were those flowers; you should rest; sure; hold the rope; she tried to skip the trail; ",90,0,"Stage 2 \xb7 Top Row","","All eight fingers","Try to keep a steady rhythm: the same speed for every key.")
B.Sf=new A.aM(B.F,B.a3,15,"V and M: Index Fingers Down","Reach down with your index fingers to V (left) and M (right).","tmt vwv vvv ovv vvt vv vvv vev v;v vvt mm kmk mmm mvm mma vv move mild milk mad mud very ever over live love gave have drive more some time same make like",90,0,"Stage 3 \xb7 Bottom Row","vm","Left index: V \xb7 Right index: M","V is below F and M is below J. Curl your finger down and back up.")
B.Sg=new A.aM(B.F,B.a3,16,"C and Comma: Middle Fingers Down","Reach down with your middle fingers to C (left) and comma (right).","m,m ,, ,,l ,, ,c ,,, ccw ,, dc m, pcp cc pc p, ccj i,, ,,, ci cat, cut, cup, cry, cure, circle, clock, check, cloud, face, price, voice, music, place,",90,0,"Stage 3 \xb7 Bottom Row","c,","Left middle: C \xb7 Right middle: , (comma)","C is below D and the comma is below K.")
B.Sv=new A.aM(B.F,B.a3,17,"X and Period: Ring Fingers Down","Reach down with your ring fingers to X (left) and period (right).","..m xx xx ax xx txx .l xxx ..u ... ... mxx .x. xl ... .q. jxx six. fix. mix. exit. extra. expect. fox. tax. relax. exam. excuse. taxi. wax.",90,0,"Stage 3 \xb7 Bottom Row","x.","Left ring: X \xb7 Right ring: . (period)","X is below S and the period is below L.")
B.Te=new A.aM(B.F,B.a3,18,"Z and Slash: Little Fingers Down","Reach down with your little fingers to Z (left) and slash (right).","lzz // //t // /e //. zzo //a zp zzz /q/ zzz f// /l/ /z/ /z // zoo zip zero size maze quiz lazy crazy puzzle froze",90,0,"Stage 3 \xb7 Bottom Row","z/","Left little: Z \xb7 Right little: / (slash)","These are the hardest bottom-row keys. Take your time.")
B.SP=new A.aM(B.F,B.a3,19,"B and N: Index Stretch Down","Stretch your index fingers down to B (left) and N (right).","wbb bb /bb nf ln nnn nnn nqn ndn nq nn bn ;b; nb bn rnr obo bnb bin ban bun bone bunny number never between brown bank band blank nine nobody",90,0,"Stage 3 \xb7 Bottom Row","bn","Left index: B \xb7 Right index: N","B belongs to your left index finger and N to your right index finger. Now you know every letter!")
B.Tb=new A.aM(B.F,B.a3,20,"Bottom Row Words","Words that use the bottom row keys.","zoom mix van cab mob nab exam mean man can vex zoom van cabin canvas mountain number zebra maybe vanish combine movie, banana, cinema.",90,0,"Stage 3 \xb7 Bottom Row","","All eight fingers","Go back to the home row after every key.")
B.Sm=new A.aM(B.F,B.a3,21,"Full Alphabet Review","Sentences that use every letter of the alphabet.","the quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog. pack my box with five dozen liquor jugs. how vexingly quick daft zebras jump. sphinx of black quartz, judge my vow.",90,0,"Stage 3 \xb7 Bottom Row","","All eight fingers","You now know the whole alphabet. Next: capital letters with the Shift key.")
B.ah=new A.lG(1,"intermediate")
B.Sy=new A.aM(B.F,B.ah,22,"Shift: Left-Hand Capitals","Hold the right Shift with your right little finger for left-hand capitals.","Asad Sara Zara Bilal Faraz Ghazala Tariq Waqar Rabia Sadia Ejaz Danish Farah Zeeshan Waleed Rashid Taimur Saad Fatima Zainab Aisha Bushra",90,0,"Stage 4 \xb7 Shift & Punctuation","","Right little: Shift (for A S D F G Q W E R T Z X C V B)","When the letter is typed by your LEFT hand, hold the RIGHT Shift. Press Shift, tap the letter, then release both.")
B.Tf=new A.aM(B.F,B.ah,23,"Shift: Right-Hand Capitals","Hold the left Shift with your left little finger for right-hand capitals.","Hamza Imran Javed Kamran Naveed Omar Usman Yasir Parveen Lubna Maryam Hina Noman Iqra Uzma Kashif Ismail Majid Hafsa Nadia Yusuf Owais Lahore Multan Karachi Peshawar Islamabad",90,0,"Stage 4 \xb7 Shift & Punctuation","","Left little: Shift (for Y U I O P H J K L N M)","When the letter is typed by your RIGHT hand, hold the LEFT Shift.")
B.S4=new A.aM(B.F,B.ah,24,"Capitals in Sentences","Start every sentence with a capital letter.","Ali is in Lahore. Sara went to Multan. Hamza and Omar play in Karachi. Zara likes the park. Bilal made a quiet plan. Maryam wrote a long letter. Usman lives near Islamabad.",90,0,"Stage 4 \xb7 Shift & Punctuation","","Both Shift keys, both little fingers",u.R)
B.T3=new A.aM(B.F,B.ah,25,"Question and Exclamation","Type ? and ! with Shift.","Why? How? Who? What? When? Where? Wow! Yes! Stop! Look! Where is Ali? He is in Lahore! What time is it? Please wait! How are you? Great job!",90,0,"Stage 4 \xb7 Shift & Punctuation","?!","? is Shift + / (right little) \xb7 ! is Shift + 1 (left little)","For ? hold the LEFT Shift and press / with your right little finger. For ! hold the RIGHT Shift and press 1 with your left little finger.")
B.SA=new A.aM(B.F,B.ah,26,"Apostrophe and Quotes","Type ' and \" correctly.","it's don't I'm she's can't they're we'll \"Hello,\" said Ali. \"Come in,\" said Sara. \"Thank you,\" I said. Don't forget the \"quotes\" and it's done.",90,0,"Stage 4 \xb7 Shift & Punctuation","'\"","Right little finger: ' (and Shift + ' for \")","The apostrophe is next to the semicolon. Hold the LEFT Shift for the double quote.")
B.Sk=new A.aM(B.F,B.ah,27,"Colon and Hyphen","Type : with Shift and - with your right little finger.","Note: Task: Goal: Step: Rule: well-known long-term self-made full-time one-way check-in Name: Ali. Plan: well-made. Tip: take a long-term view.",90,0,"Stage 4 \xb7 Shift & Punctuation",":-","Right little: : (Shift + ;) and - (hyphen)","Colon is Shift + semicolon. Hyphen is on the number row, to the right of 0.")
