B.Sq=new A.aM(B.F,B.ah,30,"Numbers 2 and 9","Reach up with your ring fingers to 2 (left) and 9 (right).","999 494 292 999 92 f9f 999 222 28 99 999 29 92 22 98 s2s 999 999 2k 22 99f 99 k22 2j 292 2s2 292 323 22 9f9 999 k9k 999 22 322 99d 322 232 9f d99 29 j9",90,0,"Stage 5 \xb7 Number Row","29","Left ring: 2 \xb7 Right ring: 9","2 is above W and 9 is above O.")
