B.ad7=s(["The teachers loud voices startled the five year old child What a scene!","The teachers\u2019 loud voices startled the five-year-old child, what a scene!","The teachers loud voices startled the five-year-old child. What a scene!","The teachers\u2019 loud voices startled the five-year-old child. What a scene!"],t.s)
