B.aCb=new A.a("p223-1",B.c,"In a computer system, a deadlock is most directly caused by which situation?",B.ar5,3,"Operating Systems","A deadlock happens when processes wait on each other in a closed loop, so none of them can proceed. Holding a resource while waiting is part of the picture, but the circular wait is what locks the system.")
B.a6N=s(["Microsoft","Apple","Google","Samsung"],t.s)
